# Backtester V2 - Windsurf Rules

## Project Overview
High-performance cryptocurrency backtesting and scanning platform.
- **Stack**: Vue 3 + TypeScript (frontend), Node.js + TypeScript + Express (backend)
- **Database**: PostgreSQL + TypeORM
- **Queue**: Redis + BullMQ
- **Exchange**: Bybit (primary), OKX (compatibility)

## Project Structure
```
backend/src/modules/
  backtester/       - Backtest engine (spot + futures)
  scanner/          - Real-time market scanner
  optimizer/        - Parameter optimization (grid search)
  futures/          - Leverage, funding, liquidation
  strategy_logic/   - Indicators, strategy, profiles
  data/             - Data loading services

frontend/src/
  views/            - BacktesterView, ScannerView, SettingsView
  stores/           - Pinia stores (backtestStore, scannerStore, etc.)
  components/       - UI components
```

